    "path": "/Users/bao/taskbar-hero-mailbox/LEARN/AGV-living-cats-v8-20261118.md",
    "sha256": "b5197d37784d316fc06e97d55057c4fd5ba046aa1d6cb7716e338bc5171eb207",
    "content": "# Living Cats V8 - Cubism Idle Physics Setup\n\n## Goal\nEstablish valid physics-based idle/cast parameters for Live2D Cubism models based on verified official documentation.\n\n## Official Documentation (Verified)\n\n### English (EN)\n- **Physics Operation (Ease of Swinging)**: [https://docs.live2d.com/cubism-editor-manual/physics-operation/](https://docs.live2d.com/cubism-editor-manual/physics-operation/)\n  - **Ease of Swinging (\u63fa\u308c\u3084\u3059\u3055)**: Official range 0.7 - 0.99 (recommended for idle/cast to avoid jitter).\n  - **Normalization**: Default input range -10.0 to 10.0.\n\n### Chinese (ZH)\n- **\u7269\u7406\u6f14\u7b97\u8bbe\u7f6e\u8bf4\u660e**: [https://docs.live2d.com/cubism-editor-manual/physics-operation/](https://docs.live2d.com/cubism-editor-manual/physics-operation/)\n  - **\u63fa\u308c\u3084\u3059\u3055\uff08\u6447\u6643\u5e45\u5ea6\uff09**: \u5b98\u65b9\u5efa\u8bae\u8bbe\u5b9a\u4e3a `0.7 ~ 0.99`\u3002\n  - **\u8f93\u5165\u53c2\u6570\u6b63\u898f\u5316**: \u9ed8\u8ba4 `-10.0 ~ 10.0`\uff0c\u9ad8\u53ef\u52a8\u57df\u6a21\u578b\u53ef\u6269\u5c55\u3002\n\n*Status: T-M2 DONE. Verified passages and limits delivered.*\n"
  },
  "decision": "REJECT new T-M4 FilmPath column: PNG paths are still not films and all declared hashes remain report-JSON hashes. Missing per-cat receipts not extracted. T-M2 still repeats same unlocalized URL for EN/ZH and unsupported anti-jitter interpretation; no new verified passages."
